            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>Looking for a lunch break that feels different?</p><p>Edible Marsh is a series of relaxed, hands-on lunchtime workshops at Lower Marsh Market, designed for people who work locally. Each session focuses on seasonal growing and creative planting - and the best part? You’ll learn new skills <em><em>and</em></em> take something home with you.</p><p>These aren’t just gardening sessions they’re friendly workshops where you can:</p><p>🌱 learn how to grow and care for edible plants<br>🌱 get tips on herbs, vegetables and seasonal planting<br>🌱 create something to take home (often free plants!)<br>🌱 enjoy a creative, social break in the middle of your day</p><p>Throughout the year, workshops also include seasonal sessions like:<br>- Pumpkin carving<br>- Wreath making<br>- Seasonal planting themes</p><p>So no two sessions are the same.</p>",
